[4543] _Birnam_] F3 F4. _Byrnane_ F1. _Byrnam_ F2.
[4544] _taint_] _faint_ S. Walker conj.
[4545] _The spirits_] _Spirits_ Pope.
[4546] _consequences have_] _consequents_, Steevens (1793).
_me thus_] _it_ Pope. _me_ Capell.
